ILANG
::HEAD{TYPE:config PROJECT:vps-deals LANG:zh}

::STATE{@SITE, brand:vpspricewatch.com, niche:VPS hosting offers, domain:https://vpspricewatch.com}

::MODULE{SETTINGS}
  locale: en-US
  timezone: UTC
  update_frequency: 6h
  base_url: https://vpspricewatch.com

::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:Official provider pages; edit here to change the rendered site}
  Hostinger | https://www.hostinger.com | https://www.hostinger.com/vps-hosting | 
  InterServer | https://www.interserver.net | https://www.interserver.net/vps/cheap-vps.html | 
  Contabo | https://contabo.com | https://contabo.com/en/vps-server/ | 

::MODULE{FIELDS}
  title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at provider

::RULE{price_missing: omit price, never infer it}
::RULE{valid_until_expired: mark expired and exclude from active listings}
::RULE{source: official provider pages only; respect robots.txt; no bypasses}
::BOUNDARY{never: fabricate offers, prices, commissions, or expiry dates|scope:permanent}
